{"analysis_markdown_path":"articles/2026/10/16/itm_1fe488d0221a2f8d/index.md","canonical_url":"https://research.google/blog/grounding-ai-agents-in-biological-reality-building-blocks-for-autonomous-wet-labs/","category_id":"llm-agent","collected_at":"2026-10-19T15:47:11Z","content_hash":"b7925da56c60439c0a0ed51bae0138a80ef111153792ca8882b1a2ce9df38b54","evidence":[{"label":"Google Research 原始技术博客","type":"url","url":"https://research.google/blog/grounding-ai-agents-in-biological-reality-building-blocks-for-autonomous-wet-labs/"},{"label":"Google Research 2026 年官方索引及日期","type":"url","url":"https://research.google/blog/2026/"},{"label":"PyLabRobot 开源机器人框架","type":"url","url":"https://github.com/PyLabRobot/pylabrobot"}],"external_id":"google-research-verid-autonomous-wet-labs-2026","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T15:47:11Z","fingerprint":"b7925da56c60439c0a0ed51bae0138a80ef111153792ca8882b1a2ce9df38b54","id":"itm_1fe488d0221a2f8d","item_id":"itm_1fe488d0221a2f8d","language":"zh-CN","published_at":"2026-10-16T00:00:00Z","reading_minutes":24,"score":92,"sort_at":"2026-10-16T00:00:00Z","source_id":"google-research","source_name":"Google Research","source_type":"manual","summary_zh":"Google Research 在 2026-10-16 发布的文章展示了面向湿实验 Agent 的 VERID：它以持续更新的 3D 语义数字孪生跟踪机器人几何、孔板体积、试剂和枪头库存，先 dry-run 与硬件校验、再执行并同步视频和动作日志。作者在适体闭环中完成 3 轮 design–test–analyze：α-thrombin 首轮 0% binder，发现固定 primer overhang 破坏 48% 折叠后，命中率升至 26.0% 和 42.1%，特异性 98.5%；myoglobin 第二轮因 63% G-quadruplex 造成特异性从 75.0% 降至 19.1%、校正命中率从 10.2% 降至 3.7%，第三轮限制该 motif 后特异性恢复至 72.4%、on-target hit rate 达 33.5%。FAP binder 案例中局部表位切除使预测加速 8.6 倍，等算力人–Agent 协作几乎将 in-silico hit rate 翻倍并得到单数字 nM binder。局限是官方博客未公开完整样本量、统计和独立复现材料，且结果只覆盖受控非感染性测试床；作者仍要求生物安全筛查、模拟先行和人类授权，不能推出完全自治实验室。","tags":["llm-agent","wet-lab","robotics","digital-twin","scientific-discovery","ai-safety"],"title":"Grounding AI agents in biological reality: Building blocks for autonomous wet labs","title_hash":"09d8448e8ce18fa6b8b7aac03ed9f84c53c5fef33c5a196c0658cbaf09546bcc","type":"blog","url":"https://research.google/blog/grounding-ai-agents-in-biological-reality-building-blocks-for-autonomous-wet-labs/"}
{"analysis_markdown_path":"articles/2026/10/19/itm_ae05343f50229804/index.md","canonical_url":"https://safeguards.anthropic.com/2026/self-assessment/","category_id":"ai-safety","collected_at":"2026-10-19T14:50:06Z","content_hash":"550707b05a2d82a1fb892629c8f6055b01eff822ba453197f89a74fb5857beeb","evidence":[{"label":"Anthropic 原始技术报告","type":"url","url":"https://safeguards.anthropic.com/2026/self-assessment/"},{"label":"Anthropic 使用政策","type":"url","url":"https://www.anthropic.com/legal/aup"},{"label":"Anthropic 2026 年 9 月滥用威胁报告","type":"url","url":"https://www.anthropic.com/threat-intelligence-report-september-2026"}],"external_id":"anthropic-safeguards-self-assessment-2026","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T14:50:06Z","fingerprint":"550707b05a2d82a1fb892629c8f6055b01eff822ba453197f89a74fb5857beeb","id":"itm_ae05343f50229804","item_id":"itm_ae05343f50229804","language":"zh-CN","published_at":"2026-10-16T00:00:00Z","sort_at":"2026-10-16T00:00:00Z","source_id":"anthropic-safeguards","source_name":"Anthropic Safeguards Blog","source_type":"manual","summary_zh":"Anthropic 在 2026-10-16 发布 self-assessment：模型在回复后复用 KV cache，以短隐藏反思指令输出固定 JSON 安全评估；通过合成对话 SFT 与六项可验证奖励 RL 蒸馏带完整策略提示的 teacher。在 Claude Fable 5 的生产流量 teacher 标签评测中，1% FPR 下召回 78% 潜在有害对话、94% 高优先级对话，平均约多生成 10 token、估算算力增量低于 2%。四档模型的 1% FPR 召回约从 16% 升至 96%，但去除 fraud/cyber 类训练后的泛化仅证明对模型已理解的类别仍有效。关键局限是 teacher 同时训练和评测、与被监控模型共享盲点，且 24 个攻击任务中把它作为 blocker 只将成功率从 79% 降至 54%，弱于独立 prompted classifier 的 25%，故适合离线监控与人工复核，而非独立实时拦截。","tags":["ai-safety","misuse-detection","self-assessment","monitoring","reinforcement-learning"],"title":"Scaling Misuse Detection with Self-Assessment","title_hash":"afdd58cb160d245bb90eeb6fa08eb9440d75c8680e3da301e4e6a3255c3ec4ec","type":"report","url":"https://safeguards.anthropic.com/2026/self-assessment/"}
